          { stage: "Stage 1 (Bootmod3 / MHD Flash)", power: "300 - 315 hp", notes: "THE ULTIMATE SLEEPER UPGRADE. Because the 211hp Fleet Edition is mechanically identical to the standard 258hp model, an OBD software flash safely unlocks a massive amount of power. It bumps power from 211hp to roughly 310hp and a terrifying 680Nm of torque. This completely transforms the heavy SUV into an incredibly fast highway missile.", zeroToHundred: "5.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "14.5s" },
          { stage: "Stage 2 (EGR/DPF/SCR Delete & Tune)", power: "330 - 350 hp", notes: "Requires mapping out the emissions systems and installing a straight-through downpipe. Note: This renders the car non-road legal in most areas but eliminates all emissions-related reliability issues. The fragile CP4.2 pump is at its absolute limit here.", zeroToHundred: "5.0s", hundredToTwoHundred: "12.8s" },
          { stage: "Stage 3 (Upgraded Turbo & CP3 Pump)", power: "380 - 400+ hp", notes: "Requires retrofitting the robust CP3 high-pressure fuel pump from the older M57 engine, upgrading the VGT turbo to a hybrid unit, and a larger intercooler. The N57 block handles this safely, turning the X4 into a genuinely scary diesel sports car.", zeroToHundred: "4.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "11.0s" }
