        engineeringData: { blockDesign: "Inline-6, Closed-deck Aluminum block with wire-arc sprayed cylinder liners. The S58 is a monumental engineering feat. The closed-deck design provides extreme rigidity, optimized to handle insane cylinder pressures. Features a 3D-printed cylinder head core for complex, highly efficient cooling passages.", crankshaft: "Forged Steel, highly robust, supported by 7 main bearings. For the LCI update, BMW utilized the lightweight forged crankshaft from the M3/M4 (G80/G82), which reduced rotating mass and allowed a torque bump to 620Nm. The timing gear is integrated directly into the forged crankshaft as a single solid piece, permanently curing the 'spun crank hub' flaw.", pistonSpeed: "17.3 m/s @ 7200 RPM.", alternator: "210A Valeo (Multi-rib belt driven).", rotatingAssembly: { pistonConstruction: "Forged aluminum alloy. Features a 9.3:1 compression ratio, specifically optimized for massive Bi-Turbo boost levels.", wristPinDiameter: "22 mm.", connectingRodLength: "150 mm. Forged rods.", rodBoltSize: "M10.", crankMainJournal: "50.0 mm.", crankRodJournal: "45.0 mm.", rodRatio: "1.66." }, cylinderHead: { combustionChamberVol: "Direct injection specific pent-roof design.", intakePortFlow: "24-valve DOHC design. Integrates Valvetronic and Double-VANOS.", valveSizes: "Intake: 30.0 mm / Exhaust: 28.5 mm.", valveStemDiameter: "5.0 mm.", camshaftDuration: "Highly variable on BOTH sides.", lifterType: "Hydraulic bucket tappets.", specialFeature: "M xDrive & LCI Upgrades. The LCI X4 M features a revised engine calibration and the lightweight crank from the M3, bumping torque from 600Nm to 620Nm. The incredible M xDrive system operates in a rear-biased 4WD mode, providing supreme traction to launch the massive S58 power, yet allows for heavily rear-biased dynamics in 4WD Sport mode." }, oilAndCooling: { oilSquirters: "Yes, dedicated high-pressure under-piston cooling jets.", oilPumpType: "Dual-chamber map-controlled pump with specialized suction capability to prevent starvation under high G-forces.", thermostatOpening: "Electronically mapped.", oilCooler: "Massive independent front-mount oil cooler." }, fuelSystem: { systemType: "Bosch High Precision Direct Injection.", maxPressure: "350 Bar (Fuel Rail). Dual ultra-high-pressure fuel pumps ensure massive fueling capacity.", injectors: "6x Bosch Solenoid Injectors." }, tuningLimits: { maxSafeTorqueStock: "850 Nm (The ZF 8HP76 handles this, requires xHP flash for optimal clamping pressure).", maxSafePowerStock: "800+ hp (The S58 block and internals are virtually indestructible under 800hp).", maxSafeRPM: "7200 RPM", weakestLink: "Plastic Coolant Tank (Splits/Destroys Coils), ECU Encryption (Requires FEMTO), Plastic Charge Pipes, Exhaust OPF." }, electrical: { coils: "Individual Coil Pack system.", ecu: "Bosch MG1 (Heavily encrypted, mandates FEMTO bench unlock)." } },
