    { stage: "Stage 3 (Upgraded Turbo)", power: "400 - 450+ hp", notes: "Requires upgrading the VGT turbo to a hybrid unit and a larger intercooler. The B57 block handles this safely, turning the X4 into a genuinely scary diesel sports SUV.", zeroToHundred: "4.5s", hundredToTwoHundred: "10.8s" }
